00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.646
the various counts that are listed.

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:21.281
So I thought that the indictment

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:24.384
provided more detail than

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.587
