00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:31.291
Which accompanied

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.792
the actual charges themselves.

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.694
And in in this,

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:37.230
you know, I was I was referring to the

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.701
I was referring to the indictment itself.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.403
So the indictment itself. Okay.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:45.071
So so can you explain there then?

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.473
Because the description

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:47.040
