00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:37.924
These details here?

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.260
Well, I'm not really surprised.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.794
I think it was an indictment

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:44.130
