00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:16.429
No, I can't

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:17.096
I can't, Aaron,

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:19.299
go through paragraph, line by line

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:20.700
and say what was new and

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.001
what was within our

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.037
within our knowledge.

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:24.938
First and foremost,

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:28.374
I have to be mindful of confidences

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:29.576
that go around the process

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:31.744
when we were looking at this matter.

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:33.446
This was in the grand jury context

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:35.682
and the things I simply can't relate.

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.183
But what I can say

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:39.519
by way of background is

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:40.954
we began our investigation

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.956
in roughly 2017.

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:43.856
At the same time,

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:44.224
we learned

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.692
