00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.329
were looking at Mr. Trump as well.

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:50.296
And I

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:51.531
was asked by the Southern District

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:53.666
to stand our stand, our efforts down,

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:56.269
