00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:04.777
I was prepared to defer to them.

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:05.712
I was surprised.

00:04:05.712 --> 00:04:07.347
Therefore, in 2018,

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:09.015
when Michael Cohen pled guilty,

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:10.183
that the Southern District

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.118
never went anywhere with that case

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:12.952
and it stopped.

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:14.087
In the meantime,

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:16.122
we had been focusing on

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:17.790
an economic crimes investigation.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.992
And I can say that because

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:20.460
Mr.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.060
Trump sued

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.862
me and the office

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:25.031
attaching our grand jury subpoena

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:25.898
in federal court.

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:27.867
And so we were on to a

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:30.036
a what I would say is a different

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.537
economic crimes investigation.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.105
And

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:33.439
and we're then moving forward

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.908
on on a broader investigation.

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:36.209
All right.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:37.610
So when Alvin Bragg was asked

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.044
the question

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:39.212
at a presser, at the presser,

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:40.613
he just was just asked,

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:41.981
and it said the

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:43.783
the question included the premise

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.985
that your predecessor declined to charge.

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:47.687
Now, in his answer to the question,

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.322
Bragg did not challenge that premise.

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:50.390
So I just want to give you a chance

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.257
to clear the record here.

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:52.158
You're saying you

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:52.859
you stood down

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:54.327
because the Southern District of New York

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:55.528
asked you to.

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:57.930
Is that the same thing as saying that?

00:04:57.997 --> 00:04:58.498
I mean, did

00:04:58.498 --> 00:04:59.532
you specifically declined

00:04:59.532 --> 00:05:00.266
