00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.636
they were merited or not at the time?

00:05:05.672 --> 00:05:08.808
I don't think we ever

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:10.443
I I'm sure I'm

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:11.611
sure a district attorney Bragg

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:13.379
has has new facts

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:13.980
that he gathered

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.349
during his investigation.

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:17.250
So

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:19.585
really, Aaron, I think I've explained it.

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:20.553
There was

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.455
a federal investigation

00:05:22.455 --> 00:05:23.723
which I deferred to.

00:05:23.723 --> 00:05:25.792
And by the time that went nowhere,

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:27.293
we then had already picked up

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:29.362
an economic crimes investigation

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.331
which had to take place during COVID

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:32.665
and in furtherance

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:33.499
