00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:54.921
It was a lot of work that we did.

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:56.656
Yes.

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:57.390
Yeah,

00:05:57.724 --> 00:05:58.458
but but

00:05:58.458 --> 00:05:58.925
