00:06:28.788 --> 00:06:29.822
and went on to build

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:31.190
the financial crimes, invest

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.692
against the Trump Organization,

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:35.094
which is the alter ego of the president.

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:36.329
One final question to you, sir,

00:06:36.329 --> 00:06:36.896
if I may,

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:37.663
and this case is,

00:06:37.663 --> 00:06:38.564
it seems in terms

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:39.632
to get to a felony, right.

00:06:39.632 --> 00:06:40.666
Is based upon

00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:41.200
the premise

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:41.801
that the president

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:43.469
of the United States did this

00:06:43.469 --> 00:06:44.771
because he wanted to be elected. Right.

00:06:44.771 --> 00:06:45.905
And he suppressed this information

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:47.006
because he wanted to be elected.

00:06:47.006 --> 00:06:49.308
We do know, as a matter of fact, from

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:50.910
not just what Michael Cohen has said,

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.512
but historical

00:06:52.512 --> 00:06:54.180
record about even involving

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.047
some of the individuals

00:06:55.047 --> 00:06:55.581
in this case,

00:06:55.581 --> 00:06:57.617
where stories were given to magazines

00:06:57.617 --> 00:07:00.453
and and been suppressed, squelched

00:07:01.788 --> 00:07:03.556
when Trump was not a candidate.

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:06.025
So are you confident that this clears

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:07.493
the hurdle that his motive

00:07:07.493 --> 00:07:08.728
