00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:21.441
from from the outside.

00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:23.309
That was district attorney's job.

00:07:23.309 --> 00:07:24.510
And I think he's obviously said

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.445
what he's going to do.

00:07:25.445 --> 00:07:26.846
But if I can, I'd like to make

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:27.580
