Number one, today was a peaceful day.

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:33.619
The federal government,

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:34.487
the FBI,

00:07:34.487 --> 00:07:36.289
the NYPD, Secret Service

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:37.523
